.DS_Store
# Generated by the isolated full-stack browser-test workflow. This file holds the
# random local-only administrator credential printed by `pnpm docker:up`. It must
# stay ignored under whatever name the harness writes: it was committed once,
# with live values, the moment a rename outran this line.
.e2e-full-stack-credentials.json
test-results/
playwright-report/
